    "title": "TransAct",
    "description": "TransACT is a finance management application the provides users with an easy and intuitive way to track their finances. Users are able to export the financial history from their bank or financial institution and them import it into TransACT. The program will then aggregate this data into one convenient place that is easy for a user to visually comprehend. Users can view their spending history at a glance or filter by a specific account to get a more in depth view. TransACT also provides charts and statistics to help the user analyze trends in their spending. Transactions can be sorted into categories that can be used to provide additional analysis. All data stored is heavily encrypted so that sensitive financial data is never at risk.",
